+284 //  fp32 numerator + per-split lse instead of the normalized bf16 row, and a
+285 //  combine kernel merges the splits in the log2 domain (the exact online-
+286 //  softmax merge: w_s = 2^(lse_s - max_lse), out = sum_s w_s*part_s / sum_w,
